1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,773
Your bank holds Aziza's account, and she sells shoes online.

2
00:00:03,773 --> 00:00:09,130
But when her customers pay by card, the money goes to Payme and Click, not to you.

3
00:00:09,130 --> 00:00:13,464
With its own acquiring, your bank earns a commission on every payment.

4
00:00:13,464 --> 00:00:16,369
The rest stays in your bank too, as deposits.

5
00:00:16,369 --> 00:00:19,333
But running payments means facing fraudsters.

6
00:00:19,333 --> 00:00:26,452
Here are the four threats every bank fears: fake shops, forged payments, double charges and stolen cards.

7
00:00:26,452 --> 00:00:34,345
Threat one, fake shops: next to Aziza's real shop, a site selling iPhones for fifty thousand soum looks just as real.

8
00:00:34,345 --> 00:00:39,940
Two bank employees check every shop, so only Aziza's real shop can take payments.

9
00:00:39,940 --> 00:00:46,511
Threat two, forged payments: a hacker copies Aziza's real payment and changes the amount to ten million.

10
00:00:46,511 --> 00:00:52,214
Every request is signed with Aziza's secret key, so the forged copy bounces off.

11
00:00:52,214 --> 00:01:00,547
Threat three, double charges: a network glitch makes her shop send the same payment twice, and her customer could be charged twice.

12
00:01:00,547 --> 00:01:05,988
Your bank charges the customer only once, and Aziza keeps a happy customer.

13
00:01:05,988 --> 00:01:12,154
Threat four, stolen cards: what if hackers break into Aziza's shop to steal her customers' card numbers?

14
00:01:12,154 --> 00:01:19,761
But cards are typed only on your bank's own page, and Aziza's shop keeps just a meaningless code, so there is nothing to steal.

15
00:01:19,761 --> 00:01:23,821
Every day, hundreds of payments like Aziza's land in your bank.

16
00:01:23,821 --> 00:01:29,976
Your bank keeps the commission, and each store gets the rest by the next banking day, in its account at your bank.

17
00:01:29,976 --> 00:01:35,309
A year later, merchants take card payments through your bank instead of Payme and Click.

18
00:01:35,309 --> 00:01:41,476
Aziza recommends you to other shop owners, and every new merchant brings your bank a commission and a deposit.

